<title>CYPRUS: SOCCER-APOEL NICOSIA WIN CYPRUS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-APOEL NICOSIA WIN CYPRUS CUP.</headline>
<text>
<p>NICOSIA, May 17 - APOEL Nicosia beat Omonia Nicosia 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in the final of the Cyprus Cup on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:  Costas Fasouliotis 87, Andros Sotiriou 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
